/ActualText (I\220m an architect turned Product Designer with 11+ years of experience shaping physical and digital spaces. For the past 5+ years at Microsoft, I\220ve designed Windows experiences across sharing, cross-device interactions and emerging AI capabilities, bringing systems thinking, interaction design and a strong focus on accessibility and craft. Outside design, you\220ll find me running, vaulting a wall or doing something that gets my heart rate up.)
